WEBVTT

00:00:00.582 --> 00:00:01.150
Hello!

00:00:01.224 --> 00:00:03.908
Need to send figures to your accountant at the end of the month,

00:00:03.858 --> 00:00:05.390
or want to do your own calculations?

00:00:05.659 --> 00:00:10.302
VaraaAi lets you download your income, your customer list, and your orders,

00:00:10.252 --> 00:00:11.710
ready to open in Excel.

00:00:12.301 --> 00:00:13.391
Let's start with income.

00:00:13.598 --> 00:00:17.631
Tap Income management, choose a period, for example This month.

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:19.231
Then tap Spreadsheet.

00:00:19.629 --> 00:00:23.071
The table shows each booking per staff member, with a totals row.

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:25.480
Tap Download, Excel.

00:00:25.783 --> 00:00:27.320
The file downloads straight away:

00:00:27.429 --> 00:00:30.878
one row per booking, with cash, bank, MobilePay,

00:00:30.828 --> 00:00:33.640
gift card and tips in separate columns.

00:00:33.987 --> 00:00:36.520
Each staff member has a totals row underneath.

00:00:37.188 --> 00:00:38.619
Next, customers.

00:00:38.966 --> 00:00:43.587
Tap Customers, and choose the group you want, for example All, New,

00:00:43.537 --> 00:00:45.019
or Haven't been back.

00:00:45.482 --> 00:00:47.579
Then tap Export to Excel.

00:00:47.967 --> 00:00:50.459
The file contains exactly the group you're looking at:

00:00:50.726 --> 00:00:54.379
name, phone number, number of visits, and amount spent.

00:00:54.977 --> 00:00:56.307
Orders work the same way:

00:00:56.485 --> 00:01:00.467
once your salon has product orders, tap Export to Excel to download them.

00:01:00.802 --> 00:01:02.067
One small reminder:

00:01:02.298 --> 00:01:04.226
these files contain customer details,

00:01:04.176 --> 00:01:06.867
so only share them with people who really need them.

00:01:07.225 --> 00:01:08.387
Now take the quiz below.
